 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Lovely that they' coming. Have you thought about changing the host name sign, pulling it off the wall and replacing it with yours? Just few bites of fruit and few ounces of water maximum. People leave more than you think. A clean bathroom with paper under the door is much nicer. A note with a big X on it saying please remove is fine. Just put it in the door rather than on the bedroom mirror where guests end up. Just a few roses in vase looks lovely. Keep the price down and buy them yourself few days early.",
